| 1 | Real EU AI Act Art. 10 sub-clause → metric mapping content | Track 08 | Out of Track 05 scope; template only defines the consuming shape |
| 2 | SHAP image format/keying guarantee | Track 15 | Explainability pipeline output format not yet fixed |
| 3 | "Pass/fail" dashboard semantics as a *scanning aid, not a verdict* | Aaradhya/Tisha (design confirm) | Interpretive convention, not in the M1 schema lock — 5-min confirm recommended before building `generator.py` |
